  "_comment_architecture": [
    "Carbon footprint declaration event with lifecycle breakdown.",
    "Architecture: the event references identifiers by URI — GTIN in epcList, GLN in readPoint/bizLocation, party GLN in source/destination. Model-, location-, and party-level master data is served by the GS1 Digital Link / Web Vocabulary resolver when those URIs are dereferenced; it is NOT embedded in the event.",
    "gs1:masterDataAvailableFor carries ONLY item/lot-level master data (e.g. countryOfOrigin, regulatoryInformation, harvestDate, EUDR plot geolocation). ilmd carries lot/instance data of the items this event creates. Observation extensions sit at event level.",
    "",
    "HTTP header: GS1-Extensions: oec=https://ref.openepcis.io/extensions/common/core/,eubat=https://ref.openepcis.io/extensions/eu/battery/",
    "See: core/docs/EPCIS_MASTERDATA_AND_EXTENSIONS.md",
    "GS1 demo prefix 952 (7-digit GCP: 9521234)."
  ],
